                                        Technical Skills
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingOne"
                                    data-bs-parent="#internshipAccordion">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-code me-2 text-success"></i>Work on client live
                                                projects
                                            </li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-database me-2 text-success"></i> Attend workshops on
                                                emerging technologies</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt me-2 text-success"></i> Hands-on coding
                                                practice sessions</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-cloud me-2 text-success"></i> Exposure to technologies
                                                you want to make career</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-asterisk me-2 text-success"></i> Mini-projects &
                                                assignments for practice</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Professional Development -->
                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingTwo">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                        data-bs-target="#collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
                                        Professional Development
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div id="collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo"
                                    data-bs-parent="#internshipAccordion">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-users me-2 text-info"></i> Resume Building & Portfolio
                                                Development</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-tasks me-2 text-info"></i> Team Collaboration (Working
                                                in groups, leadership skills)</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-comments me-2 text-info"></i> Project Management Basics
                                            </li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-intercom me-2 text-info"></i> Mock Interviews & Group
                                                Discussions
                                            </li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-save me-2 text-info"></i> Soft Skills (Confidence,
                                                Public Speaking, Adaptability)
                                            </li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-info"></i> Career Guidance &
                                                Placement Preparation
                                            </li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

            <style>
                .internship-card {
                    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
                }

                .internship-card:hover {
                    transform: translateY(-5px);
                }

                .qr-container {
                    text-align: center;
                    display: flex;
                    justify-content: center;
                    align-items: center;
                }

                .qr-container img {
                    height: 486px;
                    width: 400px;

                }


                .qr-container:hover .qr-overlay {
                    opacity: 1;
                }

                .internship-cta-btn {
                    transition: all 0.3s ease;
                    position: relative;
                    overflow: hidden;
                }

                .internship-cta-btn:hover {
                    transform: scale(1.05);
                }

                .internship-cta-btn:before {
                    content: '';
                    position: absolute;
                    top: 0;
                    left: -100%;
                    width: 100%;
                    height: 100%;
                    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), transparent);
                    transition: all 0.5s ease;
                }

                .internship-cta-btn:hover:before {
                    left: 100%;
                }

                .accordion-button:not(.collapsed) {
                    background-color: rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.1);
                    color: #2c3e50;
                    font-weight: 600;
                }
            </style>

            <!-- Required Bootstrap JS -->
            <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
            <!-- Font Awesome for icons -->
            <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/js/all.min.js"></script>

            <script>
                document.querySelectorAll('#internshipAccordion .accordion-button').forEach(button => {
                    button.addEventListener('click', function () {
                        const target = document.querySelector(this.getAttribute('data-bs-target'));

                        // जर आधीच open असेल तर manual close करा
                        if (target.classList.contains('show')) {
                            const collapse = bootstrap.Collapse.getInstance(target);
                            collapse.hide();
                        }
                    });
                });
            </script>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Font Awesome for icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">

    <!-- Custom CSS for form styling -->
    <style>
        .card {
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .form-control,
        .form-select {
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 15px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .form-control:focus,
        .form-select:focus {
            border-color: #af0b4e;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.25rem rgba(175, 11, 78, 0.25);
        }

        .input-group-text {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px;
        }

        select[multiple] {
            min-height: 150px;
        }

        optgroup {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #6c757d;
        }

        optgroup option {
            font-weight: normal;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        h5 {
            color: rgb(76, 10, 120);
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 22px;
        }
    </style>

    <script>
        (function () {
            'use strict';
            window.addEventListener('load', function () {
                var forms = document.getElementsByClassName('needs-validation');
                Array.prototype.filter.call(forms, function (form) {
                    form.addEventListener('submit', function (event) {
                        if (form.checkValidity() === false) {
                            event.preventDefault();
                            event.stopPropagation();
                        }
                        form.classList.add('was-validated');
                    }, false);
                });
            }, false);
        })();

        document.getElementById('internshipForm').addEventListener('submit', function (event) {
            const internshipOptions = document.getElementById('internshipOptions');
            if (Array.from(internshipOptions.selectedOptions).length === 0) {
                event.preventDefault();
                event.stopPropagation();
                internshipOptions.classList.add('is-invalid');
            } else {
                internshipOptions.classList.remove('is-invalid');
            }
        });
    </script>

